---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Stories from '../components/Stories.astro';
import {path,linkedin} from '../lib/site';
const fields=[['01','Technology & product','At MindMate Health, I work across product design, technology, and business strategy. My professional experience also includes AI product architecture at Culture Timing and cybersecurity project work at Finacle Soft.','projects/mindmate-health/','Explore the product work'],['02','Finance & economics','I founded ATMIYA to teach financial concepts through research and simulated portfolios. My interests in economics and venture capital also shape the way I think about resources, risk, and opportunity.','projects/atmiya/','Explore financial education'],['03','Diplomacy & public speaking','Model United Nations gave me practice researching unfamiliar perspectives, negotiating, and speaking under pressure. At GUAMUN, I cochaired the Security Council and supported conference operations.','events/','Speaking & event record'],['04','Research & writing','I founded the Journal of Interdisciplinary Inquiry and developed its editorial processes. I also write fiction: my short story “Is This Reality: A Nightmarical Tale” was published in Sin Fronteras.','projects/journal-of-interdisciplinary-inquiry/','Explore the editorial work']];
---
<Base>
<section class="personal-hero portfolio-hero"><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">Varshith Sai Ulisi · Mason, Ohio</p><h1>I like ideas<br/>that take me<br/><em>somewhere new.</em></h1><p class="personal-intro">I’m a student founder, product builder, and someone who rarely stays with just one question.</p><p class="hero-detail">My work moves between technology, finance, research, and public speaking. Sometimes I’m developing a product. Sometimes I’m working with student founders, teaching a financial concept, or trying to understand a different point of view.</p><div class="links"><a class="button" href={path('projects/')}>Explore my work ↗</a><a class="small-link" href={path('contact/#speaking')}>Invite me to speak →</a></div></div><figure class="portrait-story" data-reveal><div class="portrait-frame"><img src={path('images/varshith-ulisi.png')} alt="Varshith Sai Ulisi wearing a navy sweater" width="800" height="800" fetchpriority="high"/></div><figcaption><span>A few different interests.<br/><small>One portfolio, still growing.</small></span><a href={linkedin}>LinkedIn ↗</a></figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="portfolio-index" aria-label="Explore the portfolio"><a href="#fields">Technology & finance</a><a href={path('leadership/')}>Leadership</a><a href={path('events/')}>Speaking & events</a><a href={path('journal/')}>Writing</a></section>
<section class="section" id="fields"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Across disciplines</p><h2>What I spend my time on.</h2></div><a class="small-link" href={path('resources/profile/')}>My public profile ↗</a></div><div class="portfolio-fields">{fields.map(([n,title,text,url,label])=><article data-reveal><span class="field-number">{n}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p><a class="small-link" href={path(url)}>{label} →</a></div></article>)}</div><p class="source">Drawn from my supplied résumé and personal reflections. Current role periods and publication details are noted on the linked pages.</p></section>
<section class="personal-note section" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">A little about me</p><div class="two-col"><h2>Starting over changed<br/>how I get involved.</h2><div><p>After freshman year, I moved from Guadalajara to Mason. Model UN and service had been a big part of my life in Mexico. In Ohio, I found new interests in technology, business, and finance.</p><p>I didn’t have everything figured out before I started. Building projects made me more willing to ask questions, work with people who knew more than I did, and change my mind when something wasn’t working.</p><a href={path('about/')}>Read the longer story →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Work with other people at its center</p><h2>Building something others can use.</h2></div><a class="small-link" href={path('impact/')}>Impact & evidence →</a></div><div class="impact-pair"><a class="impact-panel" href={path('projects/uplift-academy-ohio/')}><span class="eyebrow">Uplift Academy Ohio</span><strong>~70</strong><span>students at Innovation Camp</span><p>Free STEM programs, volunteer coordination, and a showcase for students to share their ideas.</p><span class="small-link">The program story ↗</span></a><a class="impact-panel" href={path('projects/mason-venture-studio/')}><span class="eyebrow">Mason Venture Studio</span><strong>12</strong><span>startup teams in the initial cohort</span><p>Program structure, operations, and mentor connections for students developing their own ventures.</p><span class="small-link">The studio story ↗</span></a></div><p class="source">Self-reported participation, not measured long-term outcomes. Reporting dates remain to be confirmed.</p></section>
<section class="section recognition-strip" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">Selected milestones</p><h2>Practice, persistence, a few milestones.</h2><div class="resource-grid"><div><h3>Two state first places</h3><p>FBLA Business Ethics and Retail Management</p></div><div><h3>National top 15</h3><p>FBLA Business Ethics</p></div><div><h3>14 Model UN awards</h3><p>Across more than 20 conferences</p></div></div><p class="source">Self-reported results; official records and competition years require confirmation. <a href={path('recognition/')}>Full recognition record →</a></p></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The blog</p><h2>Things I’ve done.<br/>Things I’m thinking about.</h2></div><a class="small-link" href={path('journal/')}>All articles →</a></div><Stories/></section>
<section class="speaker-invite" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">Speaking & conversations</p><h2>Bring a student<br/>builder’s perspective.</h2><p>I can share what I’ve learned from developing a product, organizing student initiatives, adapting between school communities, and learning to lead through Model UN.</p><div class="links"><a class="button" href={path('contact/#speaking')}>Let’s discuss your event ↗</a><a class="small-link" href={path('events/')}>My event record →</a></div></div><aside><p class="eyebrow">Good conversations start here</p><ul><li>Building a first product and responding to feedback</li><li>Student leadership and making room for others</li><li>Finance, curiosity, and learning by doing</li><li>Diplomacy and finding common ground</li></ul></aside></section>
</Base>
